<link rel="stylesheet" href="<%-FILE('/css/fll_index.css')%>">

<%-include("fll_nav.ejs")%>

<div class="position-relative" style="height: 300px">
    <%-include("../components/image_banner", {image: "fllchallenge/2025/2025_mat_overview.png", title: "FIRST LEGO League Challenge", subtitle: "Ages 9 to 14"})%>
</div>

<div class="container mt-5">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <p>FIRST<sup>&copy</sup> LEGO<sup>&copy</sup> League introduces STEM (science, technology, engineering, and math) to children ages 9-14 (varies by region) through fun, exciting hands-on learning. 
                Participants gain real-world problem-solving experiences through a guided, global robotics program using LEGO® technology, helping today’s students, families, and educators build a better future together.</p>
            <p>In Newfoundland and Labrador, we host the annual provincial championships. Students from across the province come together to showcase their creations and ingenuity. The competition is open to schools and community groups in Newfoundland and Labrador.</p>
            <button class="btn bg-fll-red text-white">START A TEAM</button>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="yt-container">
                <iframe class="align-self-center" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Qfe6PiuHpYg?si=XpR_RGVC6bMp-LKi" title="About FIRST LEGO League" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container mt-5">
    <h1 class="fw-bold">The Challenge</h1>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4 d-flex flex-column justify-content-end" style="margin-top: 160px;">
            <%-include("components/comp_requirement_card", 
                {title: "The Robot Game", 
                number: "1",
                image: "fllchallenge/spike_robot.png",
                text: "Build and program a LEGO Robot to complete tasks on the robot game table. The mission changes each year based on new and exciting themes!",
                html: `
                    <button class='btn bg-fll-red'>Test</button>
                `
            })%>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 d-flex flex-column justify-content-end" style="margin-top: 160px;">
            <%-include("components/comp_requirement_card", 
                {title: "Robot Design", 
                number: "2",
                image: "fllchallenge/robot_design_students.png",
                text: "Your team will do a 5 minute presentation showcasing the design of your robot and your teamwork to make it!",
                html: `
                    <button class='btn bg-fll-red'>Test</button>
                `
            })%>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 d-flex flex-column justify-content-end" style="margin-top: 160px;">
            <%-include("components/comp_requirement_card", 
                {title: "The Innovation Project", 
                number: "3",
                image: "fllchallenge/innovation_project_students.png",
                text: "Research a real world problem relating to the season theme. Design a solution to the problem. Create a model or diagram of your solution. Present your solution to a panel of judges",
                html: `
                    <button class='btn bg-fll-red'>Test</button>
                `
            })%>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container my-5">
    <h1 class="fw-bold">Costs and Funding</h1>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-7 col-md-6">
            <p>Our goal is to give every student in the province the opportunity to participate in STEM education. Cost is a major barrier for students across 
                the province and we are committed to reducing costs and providing new and existing teams the resources they need to participate. </p>
            <p>Every team in the province is required to pay a registration fee of $250 CAD. After paying this registration, we will provide you all the resources required for your team to participate in FIRST LEGO League.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-5 col-md-6 px-5">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <p class="fw-bold fs-5 my-0">Cost</p>
                        <p class="fw-bold my-0" style="font-size: 68px;">$250</p>
                        <p class="fst-italic" style="margin-top: -17px;">HST Included</p>
                    </div>
                    <hr/>
                    <p class="fs-4 fw-bold">Your Team Receives:</p>
                    <ul class="cost-list px-4">
                        <li>Participation at the FIRST Provincial Championship</li>
                        <li>SPIKE Prime Kit*</li>
                        <li>2026 BIOGLOW Mat**</li>
                        <li>Travel Stipend***</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-4">
        <h2>Provided Travel Stipends for Teams</h2>
        <p>With your registration fee paid, you're team gets the opportunity to participate in the Newfoundland and Labrador Championship competition in St. John’s. We recognize that travel is another barrier for students to participate in programs like this. For teams that require overnight travel to participate, your registration fee will also unlock travel stipends to support getting to the competition.</p>

        <div class="table-responsive">
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="col">Driving >100km</th>
                        <th scope="col">Driving >250km</th>
                        <th scope="col">Driving >500km</th>
                        <th scope="col">Driving >800km</th>
                        <th scope="col">Flying From Labrador</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>$75 per participant (up to $750)</td>
                        <td>$125 per participant (up to $1250)</td>
                        <td>$150 per participant (up to $1500)</td>
                        <td>$200 per participant (up to $2000)</td>
                        <td>$800 per participant*</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <p class="fst-italic">*depending on team size, we may not be able to accommodate all flight tickets. We will do our best to provide funding for as many students and coaches as possible.</p>
    </div>
</div>